Contributions directly through GitHub are turned off for this repository. This
is necessary due to an increasing number of AI-driven issues and pull requests.
Please understand that as a human with limited time, I simply cannot be expected
to wade through these walls of text for what turned out to be mostly non-issues.

If you are a human and want to invest your valuable time reporting issues, or
even contributing code, I would be delighted to hear from you over e-mail at:

  dezertwitsh@gmail.com

If you would like to submit a patch right away, do use the same e-mail address.

Patches should be based on the "main" or "master" branch of this repository and
formatted with "git format-patch". Send them either with "git send-email" or as
a plain .patch file attachment - please do not paste the patch into a webmail
composer as it will be corrupted.

If you have never formatted or sent a patch before, this guide can help you:

  https://git-scm.com/book/en/v2/Distributed-Git-Contributing-to-a-Project#_project_over_email

While this process may seem archaic to you, it is the only way that is
respectful towards all of the time invested from both the contributor's and
maintainer's perspective.

If you need support in using the provided software, you are also invited to
write to me over e-mail or use any other provided channels of communication.

Thank you for your understanding, I am looking forward to hearing from you.
